## API reference

### Tabs

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `default_value:` / `value:` | `String` | - | The selected tab. |
| `variant:` | `:pill`, `:line` | `:pill` | A filled track with a sliding pill, or an underline. |
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | `:md` | Trigger padding and text. |
| `orientation:` | `:horizontal`, `:vertical` | `:horizontal` | Layout and arrow-key axis. |

Events: `ui--tabs:change` (`{ value }`); dispatch `ui--tabs:select` with `{ value }` to switch.

### TabsList

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant:` / `size:` | | root's | Overrides for this list. |
| `activate_on_focus:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Switch panels as the arrow keys move focus. |
| `loop_focus:` | `Boolean` | `true` | Wrap focus at the ends. |

### TabsTrigger

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `value:` | `String` | - | **Required.** Matches a TabsContent. |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Not selectable; skipped by the arrow keys. |
| `icon:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Square, label-less - add an `aria_label:`. |
| `variant:` / `size:` | | list's | Per-trigger overrides. |

### TabsContent

`TabsContent(value:)` - the `role="tabpanel"` for that value.

## Accessibility

- The WAI-ARIA tabs pattern: `tablist`, `tab` (with `aria-selected` / `aria-controls`) and `tabpanel`
  (`aria-labelledby`).
- One tab stop; ←/→ (↑/↓ when vertical, following the reading direction) move focus, Home / End jump, Enter / Space
  select.
- The indicator and panel transitions honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
